ctly exercised by `tests/unit/workflow/test_prior_art_hardening.py:64-65`; the v2 runtime uses `workflow/interpreter.py:284-305::_guard_scoped`.\n\n## Approach\n\nFirst migrate the `pass4_coach` behavioral tests and every ownership-inventory string to the live workflow/shared `review_kernel.coach` owner. Update the frozen `_CFG_MODEL_BY_DESIGN` and `_EXPECTED_RUN_REQUEST_SITES` inventory to the replacement RunRequest site, with its expected model/output class and recalculated AST-derived count; no `pass4_coach` string may remain in the inventory. Re-express the bare-string, fail-closed guard oracle through `_guard_scoped` or the interpreter execution path, preserving its `False` behavior. Preserve semantic behavior, then delete both superseded helpers and stale maintained prose/comments naming them as live owners.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/passes.py` — remove `pass4_coach` only after migration.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py` — remove `_guard_passes` only after migration.\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py`, `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/coach.py`, and `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/plan-review.yaml` — retain and test the canonical ownership/behavior.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review.py` — migrate three behavioral `pass4_coach` callers.\n- `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py` — migrate `_CFG_MODEL_BY_DESIGN`, `_EXPECTED_RUN_REQUEST_SITES`, and its derived inventory count/assertion.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_plan_review_workflow.py` and `tests/unit/workflow/test_prior_art_hardening.py` — preserve workflow coach behavior and move the fail-closed guard oracle.\n- maintained documentation/comments only where they assert the removed helper remains live.\n\n## Testing\n\nRun `pytest tests/unit/test_plan_review.py tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py tests/unit/workflow/test_plan_review_workflow.py tests/unit/workflow/test_prior_art_hardening.py`, then the relevant plan-review/workflow suite. Include a no-surviving-findings control proving no coach LLM call, a rendering/model-selection control, a derived-inventory equality control, and a bare-string guard control proving fail-closed behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `pass4_coach` and `_guard_passes` are deleted only after their behavioral tests have migrated to the canonical workflow/shared coach and `_guard_scoped` or interpreter behavior.\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py` contains no stale `pass4_coach` ownership key; its model/output expectations and AST-derived RunRequest inventory/count match the replacement live site.\n- [ ] The migrated coach tests prove applicability, decision inclusion, deterministic rendering, model selection, and no LLM call for a clean plan.\n- [ ] The migrated guard oracle sends a bare-string guard through the live scoped/interpreter path and asserts it fails closed.\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit/test_plan_review.py tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py tests/unit/workflow/test_plan_review_workflow.py tests/unit/workflow/test_prior_art_hardening.py` and the focused workflow/plan-review suite pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/passes.py","reason":"remove superseded pass4_coach helper"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/executor.py","reason":"remove superseded guard helper"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py","reason":"canonical scoped-guard behavior"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/plan-review.yaml","reason":"maintain live workflow ownership"},{"path":"tests/unit","reason":"migrate direct tests and preserve behavioral oracles"},{"path":"docs","reason":"update maintained workflow inventory/prose"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status